OL,3,GNEWSAMultiple deaths after crash
OL,4,Abetween police vehicle and car
OL,5,
OL,6,FMultiple people have died in a crash
OL,7,Finvolving a police vehicle and a car,
OL,8,Fpolice have said.
OL,10,FThe collision involved a police vehicle
OL,11,Fand a Volkswagen Passat on the A66 in
OL,12,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough in
OL,13,FTeesside, at about 03:39 BST, Cleveland
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FNorth East Ambulance Service said three
OL,17,Fvehicles were involved in total and "a
OL,18,Fnumber of patients died at the scene".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
